{"version":1,"key":"card:703","content":{"id":703,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"经济发展为什么总是呈现出繁荣与萧条的交替？短期来看有","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"库存周期","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4224bd38-31d8-4eb0-93e5-4ad66b1581c1","contentId":5968,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":723,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"、","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"产能周期","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"df3f1139-ed65-4d04-9f55-148c995adf62","contentId":5969,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":724,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"这类解释，但如果把时间尺度拉到半个世纪，是否也存在某种规律？20 世纪 20 年代，苏联经济学家康德拉季耶夫通过对英、法、美等国近百年的物价、利率、工资和对外贸易额等经济数据进行统计分析，发现资本主义经济除了已知的短周期波动外，还存在持续约 40~60 年的长波周期。这种现象后来被称为康波周期（Kondratieff Wave），也叫长波周期。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"13a1d63c-be3a-4945-be32-09723d91f7a6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"康德拉季耶夫认为，一个完整的长波周期大致经历四个阶段：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9ad80c98-78b6-4103-8618-614179a98ecb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"繁荣期：新的通用技术（如蒸汽机、电力、信息技术）出现并大规模应用，带动生产力跃升，投资和就业快速扩张","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"7e73b2e7-9992-4bfa-a589-0b2280931fdf","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"48862f8a-2391-4743-a740-512cd6c4f91f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"衰退期：技术红利逐渐消化，增长动力减弱，经济仍维持高位运行但增速放缓，资产泡沫开始积累","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a79ceb61-adf8-4ac5-a995-a2727fb71136","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"46b7d5ed-771a-488f-9e0b-722ca3cc113b","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"萧条期：结构性矛盾集中爆发，经济增长停滞甚至负增长，伴随金融危机、产能过剩和社会动荡","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"2cdf0f98-76e3-49e9-b3a7-1e08f00903ee","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"77011ac5-229a-4f3c-a990-26bb3bfb87ce","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"复苏期：旧产能","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"出清","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1dabdd59-d3ab-4d3c-a61b-c94c0484eb58","contentId":5949,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":707,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":"，制度和组织形式调整适应，新一代技术在边缘领域萌芽并逐步扩散，为下一轮繁荣蓄势","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ff80fa55-2557-4d4b-98b4-e3c5bd02fda0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c2d082e7-405e-4861-980a-15ef6b55ab53","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"173f88b5-9831-4217-a951-56555ff954ec","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"children":[{"text":"需要注意的是，康波周期并不是物理定律，而是一种对历史数据的经验归纳。各阶段之间的界限模糊，周期长度也并非精确固定，而且由于样本量极小（工业革命以来至今不过五轮左右），存在事后归因的风险。不同学者对各轮周期的起止时间划分也有较大分歧。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a2afb6bb-33ef-4ffb-8a5e-2918b3aff3db","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"尽管有这些局限，康波周期仍然提供了一种有价值的宏观视角。它提醒我们技术变革对经济的影响不是线性的，而是以浪潮的形式展开；个人和企业的命运在很大程度上受到所处时代位置的影响，有的时候顺势而为比个人努力更具决定性。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"587e315e-15bb-402d-9fda-aca03d3818e2","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"tags":["经济/康波周期"],"createTime":1778228682456,"updateTime":1793532632908,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532632908},"links":{"card:723":{"key":"card:723","type":"card","id":723},"card:724":{"key":"card:724","type":"card","id":724},"card:707":{"key":"card:707","type":"card","id":707}}}